WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.731
Donaldson's hypersymplectic conjecture, proved.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.230
Three symplectic forms that look hyperkähler, but

3
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.885
need not be parallel at all.

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.330
Deform them with classes fixed; estimates from

5
00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.360
the taming proof keep it under control.

6
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.097
Claimed: it always reaches a hyperkähler triple.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.758
Not in Lean.
